data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Good. I have enough information. Now I need to:\n1. Write DESIGN.md in hello-app\n2. Commit it\n3. Push to developer\n4. Send dispatch to developer\n\nBut wait - I also need to set up the initial repo? The hello-app is empty. The developer will create the React app. But the orchestrator only writes DESIGN.md. Let me write a simple, clear design.\n\nDesign choices:\n- Greeting: \"Hello, world!\" \n- Layout: centered vertically and horizontally in the main content area, with a Header at top and Footer at bottom via AppShell\n- Colours: greeting cycles through --color-info (blue), --color-success (green), --color-warning (amber), --color-error (red)\n- Button labels: \"Blue\", \"Green\", \"Amber\", \"Red\"\n- Use AppShell with Header title \"Hello App\", Footer with simple copyright text\n- Use Button component from @codesweep-ai/ui for colour buttons\n- Use Page component to center content\n- Greeting should be large, bold, centered\n\nActually, the mission says \"Choose the wording, the colours and the layout yourself.\" So I can choose. I'll make it simple and clear.\n\nLet me also think about whether to use Card. A Card around the greeting and buttons would be nice. The Page component centers content. Let me keep it simple: AppShell (Header + Footer) with Page inside, and a Card in the center holding the greeting and buttons.\n\nLet me write DESIGN.md.\n\nI should also check the AppShell API more carefully. Header takes title, navItems, actions, logoSrc. Footer takes children.\n\nLet me write the design."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789958867,"id":"chatcmpl-0d73a00d3b2c4c17a6b99075e957b7b8","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

